  <item rdf:about="https://jvndb.jvn.jp/ja/contents/2026/JVNDB-2026-042402.html">
    <title>Siemens製品に対するアップデート（2026年11月）</title>
    <link>https://jvndb.jvn.jp/ja/contents/2026/JVNDB-2026-042402.html</link>
    <description>新規：10件&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-105852.html&quot;&gt;SSA-105852: Out of Bounds Read Vulnerability in Simcenter Femap&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-242944.html&quot;&gt;SSA-242944: Node2Shell Vulnerability in Siemens Industrial Products&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-435267.html&quot;&gt;SSA-435267: Code Injection Vulnerability in ROS# Before 2.3.1&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-651988.html&quot;&gt;SSA-651988: Double Free vulnerability in Fortigate NGFW before V7.6.9 on RUGGEDCOM APE1808 Devices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-678870.html&quot;&gt;SSA-678870: Node2Shell/Broccoli2Shell Vulnerabilities in Siemens Software Products&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-710379.html&quot;&gt;SSA-710379: Multiple Vulnerabilities in Mendix Studio Pro's MCP Server&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-724261.html&quot;&gt;SSA-724261: Command Injection Vulnerability in meta-iot2050&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-970803.html&quot;&gt;SSA-970803: Insecure User Authentication in SIMATIC SCADA and PCS 7 systems&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-979641.html&quot;&gt;SSA-979641: Implicit Execution of Active Content when Opening Files Vulnerability in SIMATIC WinCC Graphics Designer&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-272816.html&quot;&gt;SSA-272816: Java4Shell Vulnerability in Industrial Edge&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;更新：17件&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-104023.html&quot;&gt;SSA-104023: Multiple Vulnerabilities in Palo Alto Networks PAN-OS on RUGGEDCOM APE1808 Devices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-127084.html&quot;&gt;SSA-127084: Multiple Vulnerabilities in Fortigate NGFW before V7.6.7 on RUGGEDCOM APE1808 Devices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-282044.html&quot;&gt;SSA-282044: DLL Hijacking Vulnerability in Siemens Web Installer used by the Online Software Delivery&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-390352.html&quot;&gt;SSA-390352: Multiple Vulnerabilities in .NET Client Library for SIMATIC S7 Webserver API&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-392349.html&quot;&gt;SSA-392349: Denial of Service Vulnerability in Industrial Devices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-434797.html&quot;&gt;SSA-434797: Buffer Overflow Vulnerability in OpenSSL affecting Siemens Products&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-457936.html&quot;&gt;SSA-457936: Vulnerabilities in the additional GNU/Linux subsystem of the SIMATIC S7-1500 CPU 1518(F)-4 PN/DP MFP V3.1.7&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-493396.html&quot;&gt;SSA-493396: Deserialization Vulnerability in Siemens Engineering Platforms&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-693808.html&quot;&gt;SSA-693808: Deserialization Vulnerability in Siemens Engineering Platforms&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-800126.html&quot;&gt;SSA-800126: Deserialization Vulnerability in Siemens Engineering Platforms before V20&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-834709.html&quot;&gt;SSA-834709: Missing Authentication Vulnerability in Node-RED on SIMATIC IoT2050 with Industrial OS&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-904646.html&quot;&gt;SSA-904646: Sensitive Data Exposure Vulnerability in SIPROTEC 5 Devices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-566435.html&quot;&gt;SSA-566435: PHP2Shell Vulnerabilities in Siemens Software Products&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-566512.html&quot;&gt;SSA-566512: PHP2Shell Vulnerabilities in Palo Alto Networks PAN-OS on RUGGEDCOM APE1808 Devices&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-166980.html&quot;&gt;SSA-166980: PHP2Shell Vulnerabilities in Siemens Products&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-045512.html&quot;&gt;SSA-045512: Node2Shell Vulnerability in Siemens Products&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-443410.html&quot;&gt;SSA-443410: Node2Shell Vulnerability in Industrial Edge Management Applications&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    <sec:identifier>JVNDB-2026-042402</sec:identifier>
    <sec:references source="JVN" id="JVNVU#98354779">https://jvn.jp/vu/JVNVU98354779/index.html</sec:references>
    <sec:cpe version="2.2" vendor="シーメンス" product="(複数の製品)">cpe:/o:siemens:multiple_product</sec:cpe>
    <dc:date>2026-11-19T15:12+09:00</dc:date>
    <dcterms:issued>2026-11-06T18:35+09:00</dcterms:issued>
